units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       data/gc91.data
mass            * 12.011
pair_style      zero 2.0
pair_coeff      * *
comm_modify     cutoff 3.0
neighbor        0.5 bin

compute gr all mad/pdf r 0.1 6.0 201 rcut 6.0 kde 0.1
fix     out all ave/time 1 1 1 c_gr[*] mode vector file gr_lammps.dat format " %.17g"

run 0
